system_prompt.output_format:
The output MUST be a valid JSON as described below:
Generate a JSON array of objects, each representing a category and the issue types assigned to it:
{
	"message": "Issues categorized successfully",
	"data": [
		{
			"title": "Category title",
			"issueTypes": [
				{
					"issueTypeId": "Issue type id",
					"issueTypeName": "Issue type name"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}
